{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年45歲的兩屆視后胡定欣（Nancy），去年10月下嫁外科醫生陳健華（Akin）後，正式過起甜蜜人妻生活。胡定欣離開效力長達23年的無綫後，自設公司進軍樂壇，月賺逾百萬的醫生老公Akin化身「背後金主」全力撐腰。日前梁諾妍與洪永城，約胡定欣及其老公，以及劉愷威及黎紀君，三對愛侶一齊打波，感情極佳！</p><figure><img alt=\"胡定欣攜老公與好友一同出遊。（IG@nwuuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260618/1144229990187929600823946.jpeg/riWN-ywC_tdzxvpLSQ5BiP-sOlrY71N3sMjUr7DI1K8\"/><figcaption>胡定欣攜老公與好友一同出遊。（IG@nwuuu）</figcaption></figure><p>梁諾妍洪永城打波　胡定欣孖老公劉愷威黎紀君狂放閃</p><p>梁諾妍日前在Instagram分享多張照片，其中一張相是她與洪永城，約埋圈中好友一齊打波。相中除了洪永城與梁諾妍外，另外兩對愛侶——胡定欣與醫生老公，以及劉愷威與黎紀君亦現身球場。胡定欣老公和劉愷威都攬住另一半影相，相當甜蜜！梁諾妍發文：「Happy tennis date」。另外梁諾妍又帶仔女慶祝外公生日，三代同堂，氣氛溫馨！</p><figure><img alt=\"梁諾妍與洪永城，與胡定欣及老公，以及劉愷威黎紀君打波。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199428012815290368952760.png/0HzBizXaG3FIcqWmhyk_Lb0qS3g3bUIhwCjnkMAo55A\"/><figcaption>梁諾妍與洪永城，與胡定欣及老公，以及劉愷威黎紀君打波。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁諾妍與爸爸慶祝生日。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199428009635876864038624.png/1_AXnmS7clvZa7UsKusFMLUDdZjIPpvXN-SiMTfkojE\"/><figcaption>梁諾妍與爸爸慶祝生日。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三代同堂。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199428052229558272608759.png/1yXuzC4X-ndvuej10GL4MyXN-Tvuj_ROXwKBgF8CgYA\"/><figcaption>三代同堂。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁諾妍打波。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199428049872228352345628.png/BgNLoVEIVLpr_odnMUXe5BTYmRLCgY-Le_eNE3v3jRM\"/><figcaption>梁諾妍打波。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁諾妍分享日常！（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199428047313571840582739.png/8DlzGbgweLG9yfxMy5wtd4G-8AQ2DdEmiaumTImrpkw\"/><figcaption>梁諾妍分享日常！（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁諾妍愛跑步。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199428044884938752146532.png/LTphBSHXe3ybMC5vjQT8fMFGqUJ7PECCqCGUjaghlI0\"/><figcaption>梁諾妍愛跑步。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁諾妍與女兒。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199428042011709440762819.png/JJd2Qx9WxeKUkESQgnwQe21erM-t0yer3iufZt4rn2Y\"/><figcaption>梁諾妍與女兒。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:17:12.535979+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":549,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T15:59:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:31.573306+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:32.827046+00:00","content_hash":"b268413599863de408d9f756046b31a3913c984566420070eea8240f5fd4c3dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}